\ locals, globals, recursion with locals
var counter
0 to counter
: bump ( -- ) counter 1 + to counter ;
bump bump bump counter print

: swap-via-locals ( a b -- b a ) { a b } b a ;
1 2 swap-via-locals . . cr

: hypot ( a b -- c ) { a b } a a * b b * + sqrt ;
3 4 hypot print

( locals are per activation )
: tri ( n -- t ) { n } n 0 = if 0 else n 1 - tri n + then ;
100 tri print

( to on a local )
: count-up ( n -- s ) { n } 0 { acc } n 0 do acc i + to acc loop acc ;
100 count-up print

( floats )
1.5 2 * print
10 4 / print
10.0 4 / print
2.5 int print
-7.5 abs print
0.1 0.2 + print
1e300 1e300 * print
7 -2 mod print
-7.5 2 mod print
